{"_note":"腾讯系软件清理路径（公开资料整理，非逆向所得；使用前请验证）","_sources":["公开技术文章","腾讯官方帮助文档"],"rules":[{"app":"QQ (PC版)","items":[{"desc":"接收的文件，大头","target":"%USERPROFILE%\\Documents\\Tencent Files\\<QQ号>\\FileRecv","type":"Directory"},{"desc":"图片缓存，大头","target":"%USERPROFILE%\\Documents\\Tencent Files\\<QQ号>\\Image","type":"Directory"},{"desc":"视频缓存，大头","target":"%USERPROFILE%\\Documents\\Tencent Files\\<QQ号>\\Video","type":"Directory"},{"desc":"QQ 应用数据缓存","target":"%APPDATA%\\Tencent\\QQ\\","type":"Directory"}],"never_delete":["Msg3.0.db","nt_msg.db","聊天记录数据库"],"processes":["QQ.exe"],"tips":"先在 QQ 设置里关闭群文件/图片自动下载，否则删了还会长回来"},{"app":"微信 (PC版)","items":[{"desc":"通用缓存","target":"%USERPROFILE%\\Documents\\WeChat Files\\<wxid_>\\Cache","type":"Directory"},{"desc":"视频缓存","target":"%USERPROFILE%\\Documents\\WeChat Files\\<wxid_>\\Video","type":"Directory"},{"desc":"图片缓存","target":"%USERPROFILE%\\Documents\\WeChat Files\\<wxid_>\\Image","type":"Directory"}],"never_delete":["Msg 目录（聊天记录）"],"processes":["WeChat.exe"],"tips":"旧微信号的 wxid_ 文件夹（半年以上未修改）可整个删除；微信自带清理只统计当前登录账号"},{"app":"QQ浏览器","items":[{"desc":"Chromium 内核缓存","target":"%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Tencent\\QQBrowser\\User Data\\Default\\Cache","type":"Directory"}],"processes":["QQBrowser.exe"]}]}